# Bash hooks must check out with LF: under core.autocrlf=true a fresh clone
# otherwise gets CRLF scripts, and Git Bash fails on the \r characters.
*.sh text eol=lf
# The mutation ledger is parsed line-anchored by scripts/mutation-clock-check.sh;
# a CRLF checkout would fail its date grep. Keep markdown at LF too.
*.md text eol=lf
